formers.\n  - Pellham is the largest single buyer of grid equipment in Caldria, so its 18% increase drives the overall picture.\n  - This rests on two documents and no data series. I found no confirmed orders or backlogs, and I didn't check the 2026 baseline or other utilities.\n- **Data centres:**\n  - Grid connection requests are expected to grow 9% in 2027, slower than in 2026 because power availability limits new sites.\n  - Connection requests are only a proxy for equipment orders. I found no data-centre-specific figure for transformers or substations.\n  - Growth could fall short of 9% if power availability tightens.\n- **Financing risk to utilities:**\n  - Utility bond spreads widened 30bp in Q3 2026 to 165bp. Norvane still priced a C$1.1B bond comfortably, so debt looks open.\n  - Two utility share offerings were cut back in size, so equity is less receptive. Whether the utilities can fund the plans is covered separately by n3.\n\nThese are planned figures, not confirmed purchases. Child results: n7.r1 (utilities) and n8.r1 (data centres).","ttft_ms":3212,"type":"result","duration_ms":29487,"uuid":"494a58aa-a39c-4e7b-b483-496fa25033a4","ttft_stream_ms":1701,"time_to_request_ms":135,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":9,"system_prompt":5,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":5,"input_attachments":26,"input_hooks":4,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":8,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":12,"init_frame_send":5,"engine_pickup":3,"loop_entry":5,"message_prep":4,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":15,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":5,"tool_schema_build":4,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":9,"request_build":10},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":80,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":67,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":207,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":133,"process_rss_mib_result":203,"process_anon_mib_result":121,"process_peak_rss_mib":208,"process_cp